{
  "name": "White Robe Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you are not equipped with [Heavy Armor] or a [Shield]. You gain a +[SRx3] bonus to [Recovery], and a +[SRx3] bonus to the amount of HP recovered when using &laquo;Reactive Heal&raquo; or &laquo;Reactive Area Heal&raquo;.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A battle style that uses simple clothing without armor or shields, devotes itself to prayer, and wields powerful healing powers.</p>",
